{"id":1150101,"name":"维多利亚·审查Ⅰ","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"维多利亚·审查Ⅰ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1150101]}],"trial":{"trial_id":150101,"stage":"阶段1","unlock_time":"2022-11-24 14:00:00","diary1":"维多利亚经常无故伤害管理局内工作人员和其他禁闭者，局长邮箱几乎要被针对维多利亚的控诉信件淹没。为了调查维多利亚异常行为的原因，你决定对其进行审查。","diary2":"据审查和事后调查，维多利亚天生无法凝血且免疫力差。研究室众人为治愈她，采取了过激手段，将维多利亚过度保护，不让她接触一切外界的人和信息。\n　　研究人员最终利用觉醒禁闭者的机制治好了维多利亚的病，同时因靠近不明药物变成了死役。而维多利亚在封闭教育下对生命和关爱产生了错误理解，亲手为死役化的众人带去解脱，并持续活在追求病态祝福的偏执中，落下严重的心理问题。","evidence":[{"ID":260177,"Num":1},{"ID":260179,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260178,"Num":1},{"ID":260180,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":16,"dialogue_id":250101001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250101002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":1,"dialogue_id":250101003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250101004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":3,"dialogue_id":250101005,"next":[6,10]},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250101006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250101007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250101008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250101009,"next":[14]},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250101010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250101011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250101012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250101013,"next":[14]},{"step":14,"course":3,"dialogue_id":250101014,"next":[15]},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250101015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250101016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250101017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250101018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250101019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250101020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250101021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":250101022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":